item.gx:aa12=AA-12 Auto Shotgun
item.gx:aa12.desc=Fully automatic 12-gauge fed from a 20-round drum.
item.gx:absolute_zero_sniper=Absolute Zero Sniper
item.gx:absolute_zero_sniper.desc=Bolt-action thermal sniper; a hit traps mobs in a stasis bubble.
item.gx:acid_sprayer=Acid Sprayer
item.gx:acid_sprayer.desc=Pump-action green spray; corroded mobs drip and leave sizzling puddles.
item.gx:ak47=AK-47
item.gx:ak47.desc=7.62x39 assault rifle. Wood furniture, banana mag, hard-hitting full auto.
item.gx:aurora_lance=Aurora Lance
item.gx:aurora_lance.desc=Rainbow beam that cycles fire, ice, shock and toxic every second.
item.gx:barrett_m82=Barrett M82 .50 Cal
item.gx:barrett_m82.desc=Anti-materiel rifle. .50 BMG punches through a whole line of mobs.
item.gx:black_hole_cannon=Black Hole Cannon
item.gx:black_hole_cannon.desc=5 s charge, then a slow hole that swallows projectiles and collapses.
item.gx:blink_rifle=Blink Rifle
item.gx:blink_rifle.desc=Violet orb; impact teleports you there, alt-fire swaps with the mob.
item.gx:blizzard_cannon=Blizzard Cannon
item.gx:blizzard_cannon.desc=Channelled cone of wind and snow that widens the longer you fire.
item.gx:carl_gustaf=Carl Gustaf Recoilless Cannon
item.gx:carl_gustaf.desc=84mm recoilless cannon. The heaviest shell here and the biggest crater.
item.gx:chrono_pistol=Chrono Pistol
item.gx:chrono_pistol.desc=Tags a target for 3 s; sneak-fire rewinds it along its recorded path.
item.gx:cutter_beam=Mining Cutter
item.gx:cutter_beam.desc=Short green-white beam that mines blocks, ramping while held.
item.gx:dragon_breath_flamer=Dragon-Breath Flamer
item.gx:dragon_breath_flamer.desc=Continuous flame cone; the colour ramps orange to blue for bonus damage.
item.gx:drone_launcher=Combat Drone Launcher
item.gx:drone_launcher.desc=Launches a hovering drone that orbits you and lasers hostiles.
item.gx:energy_cell=Energy Cell
item.gx:energy_cell.desc=Ammo for every Galaxy Forge weapon.
item.gx:fgm148_javelin=FGM-148 Javelin
item.gx:fgm148_javelin.desc=Guided anti-tank missile. Locks onto the nearest mob and chases it.
item.gx:fireball_launcher=Fireball Launcher
item.gx:fireball_launcher.desc=Slow lumpy fireball; leaves a burning trail and bounces once.
item.gx:foam_longshot=Foam Longshot
item.gx:foam_longshot.desc=Scoped foam rifle. Fast, flat darts that knock mobs back hard.
item.gx:foam_popper=Foam Popper
item.gx:foam_popper.desc=Foam dart pistol. Hold to rapid-fire; darts arc, bonk mobs back, and stick to walls.
item.gx:foam_storm=Foam Storm
item.gx:foam_storm.desc=Six-barrel foam blaster. Every shot sprays a volley of six darts.
item.gx:frost_lance=Frost Lance
item.gx:frost_lance.desc=Ice-blue beam that stacks Chill; five stacks freeze the target solid.
item.gx:gatling_laser=Six-Barrel Gatling Laser
item.gx:gatling_laser.desc=Spin-up auto laser; ramps to a hairline beam, momentum on release.
item.gx:glacier_shard_launcher=Glacier Shard Launcher
item.gx:glacier_shard_launcher.desc=Jagged ice shards stick fast and grow a slowing crystal cluster.
item.gx:glaive_disc=Arc Glaive Thrower
item.gx:glaive_disc.desc=Spinning lightning disc that bounces four targets then boomerangs home.
item.gx:good_boy_cannon=Good Boy Cannon
item.gx:good_boy_cannon.desc=Paw-print star bolts; heals and buffs your pup, sneak-fire calls them.
item.gx:gravity_well_launcher=Gravity Well Launcher
item.gx:gravity_well_launcher.desc=Orb that opens a 4 s singularity; your own bolts bend into it.
item.gx:grenade_emp=EMP Grenade
item.gx:grenade_flashbang=Flashbang
item.gx:grenade_frag=Frag Grenade
item.gx:grenade_incendiary=Incendiary Grenade
item.gx:grenade_smoke=Smoke Grenade
item.gx:helios_sniper=Helios Sniper
item.gx:helios_sniper.desc=Bolt-action 8x green needle; hold breath, kill-cam slow on far kills.
item.gx:inferno_revolver=Inferno Revolver
item.gx:inferno_revolver.desc=Six-shot fire revolver; fan the hammer or beat the speedloader QTE.
item.gx:ion_disruptor=Ion Disruptor
item.gx:ion_disruptor.desc=Blue-static pulse; stuns machines and debuffs mobs.
item.gx:jungle_ops_boots=Jungle Ops Boots
item.gx:jungle_ops_chestplate=Jungle Ops Chestplate
item.gx:jungle_ops_helmet=Jungle Ops Helmet
item.gx:jungle_ops_leggings=Jungle Ops Leggings
item.gx:m134_minigun=M134 Minigun
item.gx:m134_minigun.desc=Six-barrel rotary gun. Spins up, then fires 20 rounds a second.
item.gx:m14_ebr=M14 EBR
item.gx:m14_ebr.desc=Designated marksman rifle: 7.62 semi-auto in a chassis with a 4x scope and bipod.
item.gx:m16a4=M16A4 Burst Rifle
item.gx:m16a4.desc=Full-length 5.56 rifle with ACOG. Three-round burst per pull.
item.gx:m20_bazooka=M20 Super Bazooka
item.gx:m20_bazooka.desc=3.5-inch rocket launcher. Unguided rocket, big blast, blows a crater.
item.gx:m249_saw=M249 SAW
item.gx:m249_saw.desc=Belt-fed 5.56 light machine gun with bipod and 200-round pouch.
item.gx:m24_sws=M24 Sniper Rifle
item.gx:m24_sws.desc=Bolt-action .308 sniper system with a long 10x scope and bipod.
item.gx:m4a1_carbine=M4A1 Carbine
item.gx:m4a1_carbine.desc=5.56mm carbine with quad rail and holographic sight. Full auto.
item.gx:m79_launcher=M79 Grenade Launcher
item.gx:m79_launcher.desc=40mm break-action 'thumper'. Lobs high-explosive grenades in an arc.
item.gx:m9_pistol=M9 Service Pistol
item.gx:m9_pistol.desc=9mm semi-automatic sidearm. Hold to fire as fast as the slide cycles.
item.gx:magma_mortar=Magma Mortar
item.gx:magma_mortar.desc=High-arc lava blobs leave merging magma pools that melt armour.
item.gx:magnum_44=.44 Magnum Revolver
item.gx:magnum_44.desc=Six-shot stainless revolver. Slow, loud, and hits like a truck.
item.gx:meteor_rifle=Meteor Caller Rifle
item.gx:meteor_rifle.desc=Marker beam calls five meteors down onto the marked spot.
item.gx:mirror_pistol=Ricochet Laser Pistol
item.gx:mirror_pistol.desc=Rapid orange sidearm; beams ricochet off polished blocks.
item.gx:mosin_nagant=Mosin-Nagant
item.gx:mosin_nagant.desc=Classic bolt-action 7.62x54R with a wooden stock and a short PU scope.
item.gx:mp5_smg=MP5 Submachine Gun
item.gx:mp5_smg.desc=Roller-delayed 9mm SMG. Smooth, accurate full auto.
item.gx:multitool_diamond=Diamond Multi-Tool
item.gx:multitool_iron=Iron Multi-Tool
item.gx:multitool_netherite=Netherite Multi-Tool
item.gx:multitool_wood=Wooden Multi-Tool
item.gx:nanite_swarm_rifle=Nanite Swarm Rifle
item.gx:nanite_swarm_rifle.desc=A flocking nanite cloud that re-seeks up to three targets before dissolving.
item.gx:orbital_designator=Orbital Designator
item.gx:orbital_designator.desc=Lock a spot for 2 s, then a pillar of light slams down.
item.gx:phoenix_repeater=Phoenix Repeater
item.gx:phoenix_repeater.desc=Flaming phoenix bolt flies out and returns; catch it to heal.
item.gx:plasma_lance=Plasma Lance
item.gx:plasma_lance.desc=Charge 1.2s, then a piercing beam with travelling rings.
item.gx:plasma_repeater=Plasma Repeater
item.gx:plasma_repeater.desc=Full-auto violet bolts with a perfect-vent window.
item.gx:plasma_scattergun=Sticky Scattergun
item.gx:plasma_scattergun.desc=8 sticky magenta globs that chain-detonate.
item.gx:prism_beam=Prism Beam
item.gx:prism_beam.desc=White channel beam that refracts into R/G/B spectra through glass.
item.gx:pulse_carbine=Pulse Carbine
item.gx:pulse_carbine.desc=3-round cyan burst. Third bolt is a kicker.
item.gx:railgun_mk2=Railgun Mk II
item.gx:railgun_mk2.desc=Charge 1.5 s, then a piercing slug that scars the tunnel it crosses.
item.gx:red_dot_marksman=Red Dot Marksman
item.gx:red_dot_marksman.desc=Semi-auto crimson hairline; always-on dot, headshot bonus.
item.gx:remington_870=Remington 870
item.gx:remington_870.desc=12-gauge pump shotgun. Eight buckshot pellets per shell.
item.gx:repulsor_gauntlet=Repulsor Gauntlet
item.gx:repulsor_gauntlet.desc=Palm shockwave; hold to charge, fire at the ground to rocket-jump.
item.gx:saber_amber=Amber Lightsaber
item.gx:saber_azure=Azure Lightsaber
item.gx:saber_crimson=Crimson Lightsaber
item.gx:saber_jade=Jade Lightsaber
item.gx:saber_storm=Storm Lightsaber
item.gx:saber_violet=Violet Lightsaber
item.gx:sandstorm_boots=Sandstorm Boots
item.gx:sandstorm_chestplate=Sandstorm Chestplate
item.gx:sandstorm_helmet=Sandstorm Helmet
item.gx:sandstorm_leggings=Sandstorm Leggings
item.gx:scar_h=SCAR-H Battle Rifle
item.gx:scar_h.desc=7.62 NATO battle rifle in flat dark earth with a red-dot optic.
item.gx:seeker_rack=Seeker Missile Rack
item.gx:seeker_rack.desc=Lock up to four targets, then ripple-fire four homing missiles.
item.gx:sentinel_kit=Sentinel Turret Kit
item.gx:sentinel_kit.desc=Unfolds a 30 s auto-turret; synced turrets deal bonus damage.
item.gx:sonic_cannon=Sonic Cannon
item.gx:sonic_cannon.desc=Charge a 45-degree shockwave that stuns mobs and shatters glass.
item.gx:splitter_rifle=Splitter Rifle
item.gx:splitter_rifle.desc=Splits into homing shards at range or on impact.
item.gx:spore_launcher=Spore Launcher
item.gx:spore_launcher.desc=Arcing spore pod bursts into a poison cloud and three homing darts.
item.gx:starforge_bow=Starforge Bow-Gun
item.gx:starforge_bow.desc=Star arrows stick as constellation nodes; three link into a field.
item.gx:storm_caller=Storm Caller
item.gx:storm_caller.desc=Mark a spot, then three lightning strikes hunt mobs inside the circle.
item.gx:sunfire_cannon=Sunfire Cannon
item.gx:sunfire_cannon.desc=Slow golden plasma sphere leaving a burning sun-scar.
item.gx:supernova_rifle=Supernova Rifle
item.gx:supernova_rifle.desc=3 s overcharge fires a white slug that detonates as a supernova.
item.gx:tesla_coil_gun=Tesla Coil Gun
item.gx:tesla_coil_gun.desc=Forked arc that jumps five targets; the coil charges a sixth jump.
item.gx:thompson_m1928=Thompson M1928
item.gx:thompson_m1928.desc=The Chicago typewriter: .45 ACP, 50-round drum, walnut furniture.
item.gx:thunder_shotgun=Thunder Shotgun
item.gx:thunder_shotgun.desc=Pump-action fan of six arcs; the muzzle clap shoves mobs back.
item.gx:tri_beam=Focus Tri-Beam
item.gx:tri_beam.desc=Three violet beams converge at a dialled focal distance.
item.gx:twin_photon_smg=Twin Photon SMG
item.gx:twin_photon_smg.desc=Two barrels alternate; every 12th shot is a golden tracer.
item.gx:umbra_smg=Umbra SMG
item.gx:umbra_smg.desc=Silent dark bolts; five hits detonate a shadow burst.
item.gx:void_beam=Void Beam Rifle
item.gx:void_beam.desc=Channeled void beam; four hits open a rift that yanks the target up.
item.gx:volt_whip=Volt Whip
item.gx:volt_whip.desc=Crack a mob to stun and reel it in; alt-use grapples to a block.
